{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03FA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$a : U' \\to U$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{I}(U) \\to \\mathcal{I}(U')$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-restriction-along-monomorphism-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8dc2c0abe3b38e9d4b2952063b555aa4f4a94e3f7ef56ce52d69084bc098dc00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d587b1d3757e8b117ea65b3dbaed3872ac0aa1293b99d0f20eec92ab30f42433", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site. Let <MATH_0002> be a\nmonomorphism in <MATH_0003>. Then for any injective <MATH_0004>-module\n<MATH_0005> the restriction mapping <MATH_0006>\nis surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d2d674430a3908ffe766207d7ec635cc32212eaa3897cae73fcc2bfe4292634e", "unit_id": "tag:093X:statement"}
